# Force LF regardless of the checking-out machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# This machine's global core.autocrlf is `true`, which rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout for anything git treats as text. WordPress Coding Standards'
# Generic.Files.LineEndings sniff requires LF, so without this override every
# file freshly written or edited here fails PHPCS until manually converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
